{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JmS0RKRz8GWQ5jaaIAFSLQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:18.687349+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JmS0RKRz8GWQ5jaaIAFSLQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fymvQjRwmSRH8a1icRhSnhgO935kh00hRbDIfbSYsCLB5WWNhnvBWTMpSmmjGhtI0XyU6HPtcLuRib1ywNQtGkWw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp#imgIndex=0\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><span><strong><span><span><span>燕</span></span></span><span><span><span>山</span></span></span><span><span><span>大</span></span></span><span><span><span>学</span></span></span><span><span><span>电</span></span></span><span><span><span>气</span></span></span><span><span><span>工</span></span></span><span><span><span>程</span></span></span><span><span><span>学</span></span></span><span><span><span>院</span></span></span></strong></span></section><p><span><span><span><span>为</span></span></span><span><span><span>电</span></span></span><span><span><span>院</span></span></span><span><span><span>学</span></span></span><span><span><span>子</span></span></span><span><span><span>提</span></span></span><span><span><span>供</span></span></span><span><span><span>一</span></span></span><span><span><span>手</span></span></span><span><span><span>资</span></span></span><span><span><span>讯</span></span></span></span></p></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/HRoDDYeYibjAFkDQUqliaaib6OmibTT3dS02k2flNxLUQkJ4IUTguIiadpqatcibkibdCyIVwiafS0Eib65EP0X4yVCZib8w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp#imgIndex=1\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>根据《燕山大学2027年接收推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）报考须知》（https://zsjyc.ysu.edu.cn/info/1244/7081.htm）和相关工作要求，电气工程学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）工作即将开始，现将相关事项公告如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>一、招生计划</span></strong></p><p><span>1. 我院按规定可接受应届本科毕业生报考的学科（类别）、专业（领域）均可接收推免生，学制为3年，接收总人数不超过当年全日制硕士计划的50%。具体招生专业如下表所示。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/82XHqMsvruWibSCicAIYib8Sw8xoxHGEYfOGy2viasVbBvUUlrpIsia9dIDOibhibv1hpugplDZUT9cmtChsA5cV7aPF631Jbq4zdnLxjge7kBb1Oc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2. 我院学术型博士生招生专业均可接收本科直博生，学制为5年。直博生招生人数不超过当年学术型博士生招生人数的30%。具体招生专业如下表所示。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/82XHqMsvruWpmAnt77OpGp0KEq3qWXWgW08KtWsWzKQIfPQPvIFjU6QoiaXIZRg9THVQJiadib8yxVC2DHFJm1ibKGWSsnic52Pn0Zly7zadgdzY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>二、报名条件</span></strong></p><p><span>申请人必须是具有推荐免试授权高校的全日制应届本科毕业生，并获得所在学校推免资格，占用所在学校推免指标，推荐手续完备。</span></p><p><strong><span>三、报名及复试流程</span></strong></p><p><span>1. 从本通知发布之日起到中国研究生招生信息网“推免服务系统”关闭前，有意就读我院研究生的推免生均可进行报名和复试。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>报名时，请务必填写以下报名信息收集表：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>【腾讯文档】燕山大学电气工程学院2027年接收推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）报名信息收集表 https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DWWR2dXp1cXVIUVFn</span></p><p><strong><span><span>也可扫描下方二维码填写报名信息收集表：</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/82XHqMsvruUUs8dgpQrCYmGJib9v7micXlMJHvKJAC6DGzxyhOpkw5auy3iaxwrjaqZQckfd5T9Za5Ha5hk1L9GuJKB2a6ATq4M65RBHJBALjI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2. 考生完成报名信息收集表填写后，请将下列材料按顺序整理成一个电子版文件（PDF版）发送至邮箱：dykyk@ysu.edu.cn，</span><span><span>邮件主题为：推免材料+本人姓名+本人手机号（例：推免材料+张三+13912345678）</span></span><span>，等待学院对材料进行审核。</span></p><p><span>（1）居民身份证；</span></p><p><span>（2）本科在校学习成绩单（加盖学校教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><span>（3）所在学校出具的政治思想和现实表现鉴定（无固定格式要求，必须有）；</span></p><p><span>（4）大学外语等级考试成绩单；</span></p><p><span>（5）发表的论文、专利及获奖证书、荣誉证书；</span></p><p><span>（6）报考推免直博生的，还需提交《燕山大学2027年攻读博士学位研究生报名登记表》（附件1）以及2份《报考燕山大学2027年推免直博生专家推荐书》（附件2）（由报考专业领域内的两位</span><strong><span>正高职</span></strong><span>专家推荐，并加盖推荐人所在单位公章）</span></p><p><span>3. 对于报名材料审核通过的考生，学院将视报名情况进行线上复试，具体时间另行通知，请考生注意保持手机畅通。</span></p><p><strong><span>复试形式：</span></strong><span>外校学生线上面试；本校学生按照学科专业要求进行线下或者线上面试；</span></p><p><strong><span>复试内容：</span></strong><span>英文自我介绍、5分钟PPT自我介绍（本科期间学习经历、实践经历、获得的荣誉等）、专业知识问答、综合素质考核等；</span></p><p><span>4. </span><strong><span>报名时注意事项：</span></strong><span>发送电子版材料时，邮件正文请务必写明姓名、报考专业、报考类型和联系电话。推免生报考前均可提前联系意向导师；报考本科直博生务必要向意向导师确认其是否具有2027年博士生招生资格。</span></p><p><strong><span>四、系统招考流程</span></strong></p><p><span>考生应同时登录中国研究生招生信息网“推免服务系统”完成信息注册、网上报名、填报志愿等操作，具体招考流程如下：</span></p><p><span>1、考生填报专业志愿。符合报名条件的学生应于中国研究生招生信息网“推免服务系统”（网址：yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）开通后进行信息注册、网上报名（包括上传照片和网上支付报名费）、填报志愿（选择报考学院和专业）。</span></p><p><span>2、学校发出复试通知。收到我校复试通知的学生应在规定时间内上网点击“同意复试”（逾期将取消复试资格），并按规定时间和要求参加复试。</span></p><p><span>3、考生参加复试。经我校同意参加复试的考生，由考生报考专业所在学院组织安排复试，复试以综合面试为主，复试结果由报考学院汇总后上报。</span></p><p><span>4、学校发出待录取通知。收到我校待录取通知的考生应在规定时间内上网点击“同意待录取”，逾期未确认的，视为考生自愿放弃录取资格。</span></p><p><strong><span>五、其他事宜</span></strong></p><p><span>1、学院将于2027年9月新生入学后对接收的推免生进行资格复审，出现下列情况之一者，将取消其录取资格：</span></p><p><span>（1）入学前未取得本科毕业证书及学位证书；</span></p><p><span>（2）入学时在本科院校存在期内处分；</span></p><p><span>（3）推免相关材料存在弄虚作假情况。</span></p><p><span>2、学院接收的推免生不得参加2027年全国硕士研究生入学考试统考报名和考试，不得与用人单位签订就业协议书。</span></p><p><span>3、我院仅招收报考类别为“非定向就业”的推免考生，待录取考生（燕山大学应届生除外）应向我院领取《调档函》，带回学校调取档案，并按规定时间交（寄）到报考学院档案接收部门。</span></p><p><span>4、若国家政策变化，学院将做相应调整。</span></p><p><span>5、本须知由燕山大学招生就业处和电气工程学院负责解释。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>附件1：<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JmS0RKRz8GWQ5jaaIAFSLQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">燕山大学2027年攻读博士学位研究生报名登记表.doc</a></span></p><p><span>附件2：<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JmS0RKRz8GWQ5jaaIAFSLQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">报考燕山大学2027年博士研究生专家推荐书.doc</a></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/82XHqMsvruUV5t1iaH6a2fHv4oic9icPu1uoCN0jA0AW9YdPoO6xvIhYUzfyib3PMr4UxgX3dPow8XCxR7qficzfMl7WQ8Xra59pYwfcs0ica4DKE/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>材料来源|电气工程学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>图文排版|陈静涵</span></span></p><p><span><span>初审初校|王炎奥</span></span></p><p><span><span>二审二校|乔安平 李涵汐</span></span></p><p><span><span>三审三校|赵雨桐</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>终审终校|刘凯</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/82XHqMsvruUdArvzxAykiccsuZL65WoKlm1q99cAxMrnvib8C4osIhib8kuzrIibU1JlN6ZKsN6DWmkbibMRDZyEYPqWic0chqI5bzWJu3tvib6yGI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/82XHqMsvruUU7JaXQceA397nJcgTjSx4SVoZFQhxCs9tWohml1mxPNCCjNDNSz3B33Q4aCP4TTDiaT4hLT4ia6y3v0Aol8smaV0Z5Gv1HNWaw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/82XHqMsvruXGUIzuzH9W50aFStWqsCoMBicRrR0Dx3Q4OvZ7TT5EltRsLmkdHcVaK5fpfOW1AXp1KG1mehIw37Fx51Mbic4RqR7XkMicUChDTA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/82XHqMsvruXJ5IJK8eBCaXo2geibsxpictFBUXUSqKkicUHflMibXmBhr2HPTU4jr706ibMVVb7IkjhygByMq8ic6DlTq4ayxl8LJ1eSFeTzBoaUc/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/82XHqMsvruXU5x68SItUib9HAyffBQ4syJgaAGV9eutYOPeBJPMiaicCogecFIDuFR0FDibboicUyodvGum2MjHbEN7S4rSBPicrf6NIicbqG6Pt0A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/82XHqMsvruUlRpAT45kbQiaxBicrJJbD3LomhLk5A8GNUlYhctatuves0wviaV9kkvnzJbXYMibrlcZ8R8D0jjib0yD8SWeHykB7XPchJSRC1ibAk/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>点亮“在看”，一起精彩！</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/82XHqMsvruV2wumcCtl00FkRM2cicdr7xKTpl9iaOUTy2adiaicibBZDLoqBDYIx98TVK76JdppibrsxUXYZ8CwRNEfLicGBnVpbHzbaAtbCCibANLE/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"bc4f92fb8334b61d92aa113584b2db414589ed5394c7f5f96d03a9fb32acefce","textLength":1940,"sourceSha256":"8ee7c3142fa53fe929a2fbe300c5d41735243a15cf05c36b243665d43dc3c032","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9e69cfdcc56c32162f65","title":"2026年燕山大学电气工程学院2027年接收推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）报考须知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:18.687349+00:00"}
